{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","星灵召唤"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","在自己身边召唤“水瓶座的阿葵亚”协助战斗。阿葵亚继承露西的部分属性，登场时以及之后每隔一段时间立刻使用魔法制造水龙卷造成范围伤害，击飞敌人并使目标眩晕。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","在自己身边召唤“水瓶座的阿葵亚”帮助战斗。阿葵亚拥有露西120%的最大生命值，其余属性与露西相同。阿葵亚登场时立即使用魔法制造水龙卷，对以敌人最密集处为中心的半径1格范围内的所有敌人造成300% + 30% ATK的伤害，并使受影响的敌人被击飞并眩晕持续2秒，后续每10秒使用一次。阿葵亚的普通攻击造成100% + 10% ATK伤害，且攻击距离为10。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":97,"end":103,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":155,"end":161,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":93,"end":107,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":151,"end":165,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","阿葵亚制造的水龙卷伤害提高至325% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","阿葵亚制造的水龙卷伤害提高至350% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","阿葵亚制造的水龙卷伤害提高至375% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","阿葵亚制造的水龙卷伤害提高至400% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","露西飞踢"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对全场累计伤害最高的敌人进行远距离的飞踢，造成一定伤害并使其眩晕。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","对全场累计伤害最高的1名敌人进行远距离的飞踢，造成240% + 20% ATK的伤害与持续2.5秒的眩晕。飞踢后露西会回到释放技能前的位置，且技能期间处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":77,"end":79,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至260% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至280% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至300% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","星灵衣-水瓶座形态"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","释放终极技能后变为“星灵衣-水瓶座形态”，可以使用魔法制造水龙卷造成范围伤害，击飞敌人并使目标眩晕。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","自己在释放终极技能后变为“星灵衣-水瓶座形态”直至战斗结束。之后自己也能够使用水魔法制造水龙卷，对以敌人最密集处为中心的半径1格范围内的所有敌人造成300% + 30% ATK的伤害，并使受影响的敌人被击飞并眩晕持续2秒。“星灵衣-水瓶座形态”下自身攻击距离为10。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":78,"end":84,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":74,"end":88,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至350% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至375% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至400% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提升12点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提升16点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提升20点急速。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","水流屏障"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","阿葵亚与“星灵衣-水瓶座形态”形态下的露西，能够使用“水流屏障”为最虚弱的友军添加护盾。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","阿葵亚与“星灵衣-水瓶座形态”形态下的露西，能够使用“水流屏障”为最虚弱的友军添加能够抵御450% ATK伤害的护盾，持续8秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":33,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":45,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","护盾抵御值提高至500% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","护盾存在期间，被护盾保护的角色额外提升50点远程防御。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","护盾抵御值提高至550% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","若露西能量达到上限且阿葵亚在场，阿葵亚额外提高攻击速度。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","若露西能量达到上限且阿葵亚已经在场，阿葵亚额外提高80点攻击速度。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","星之大河"]]}